1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Lift your big toe.

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:01,910
Easy.

3
00:00:01,910 --> 00:00:03,156
Now lift JUST

4
00:00:03,156 --> 00:00:04,517
the next one.

5
00:00:04,517 --> 00:00:05,579
The whole gang came,

6
00:00:05,579 --> 00:00:05,979
right?

7
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,300
They share ONE string.

8
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:09,054
Your big toe

9
00:00:09,054 --> 00:00:10,665
has its own muscle.

10
00:00:10,665 --> 00:00:11,810
The other four?

11
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:12,990
ONE muscle...

12
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:14,133
four strings.

13
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,270
Now curl them.

14
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:16,567
Same deal underneath.

15
00:00:16,619 --> 00:00:17,900
Your brain's no help:

16
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:18,612
scans found

17
00:00:18,612 --> 00:00:19,462
no neat spot

18
00:00:19,462 --> 00:00:20,733
for each toe.

19
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,221
But two

20
00:00:21,221 --> 00:00:22,730
foot-painting artists,

21
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:24,033
born without arms,

22
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:26,867
had one for EVERY toe.

23
00:00:26,923 --> 00:00:27,604
So...

24
00:00:27,604 --> 00:00:28,433
practise.

25
00:00:28,433 --> 00:00:30,120
Big toe first.

